dependent_object: cannot distribute table "dep_t": view public.dep_v depends on the table; the table is replaced by a new one
dependent_object: cannot distribute table "dep_t": function public.dep_f(public.dep_t) uses the row type of the table
dependent_object: cannot distribute table "dep_t": publication "dep_pub" publishes the table
HINT:  kingres.table_change_report() lists them with the warnings and notes.
